      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected directly into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 either the Ingest or Query agent process \u2014 immediately before that process starts. A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it only into the child process\u0027s environment. Critically, the Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated and never holds the key itself, which prevents a compromised Hub process from leaking the credential by inspecting its own environment variables.",
